{"id": 1781712, "name": "先驱·新稻妻", "name_cn": "", "description": "那个隐藏在暗流之下的人终于现出真身，但此刻，对此毫无察觉的将军一行已抵达了新稻妻城，这之后，又会有怎样的展开？\r\n\r\n--------------------\r\n\r\nDirector/Producer:\r\nDillon Gu\r\n\r\nWriter:\r\nDillon Gu\r\n\r\nLead Animator:\r\nDillon Gu\r\nTony Garcia\r\nShane Newville\r\nRaymond Luc\r\n\r\nAnimators:\r\nBrandon Kolaczewski\r\nAtelier\r\nScaasI\r\nOrionsEgg\r\nAnimSebs\r\nMirabeau\r\nMelanie Stern\r\nCaehLyn\r\nSXR123 \"Dave\"\r\nTerrible Joe\r\n\r\nRiggers:\r\nTony Garcia\r\nAnimSebs\r\nJeff Burke\r\n\r\nConcept Art:\r\nYannic Kawan\r\nJeff Chen\r\n\r\nCharacter Modeling:\r\nJ5\r\nEllie Swain (rukikuri)\r\nRT3Filmz\r\nMirabeau\r\nChloe Worthy\r\nDillon Gu\r\n\r\nEnvironment/Prop Modeling:\r\nYi Xuan Zhou\r\nChloe Worthy\r\nJeff Burke\r\nDillon Gu\r\n\r\nFX Artists:\r\nCody Winchester\r\nLateasusual\r\nKristof Dedene\r\n\r\nLook Dev:\r\nKristof Dedene\r\nJ5\r\nDillon Gu\r\n\r\nCompositing:\r\nDillon Gu\r\nCody Winchester\r\nWyatt Hall\r\n\r\nDevelopers:\r\nLateasusual\r\nCody Winchester\r\n\r\nRender Tech:\r\nCody Winchester\r\nDillon Gu\r\nJeff Burke\r\n\r\nProduction Assistant:\r\nJeff Burke\r\n\r\nMusic:\r\nBen Squires\r\n\r\nSound:\r\nDan Pugsley - Supervising Sound Editor\r\nEliran Sivan - Sound Design\r\nCaehlyn\r\nShane Newville\r\n\r\n“Genshindou”\r\nPerformance by Diana Garne\r\nLyrics by DatenKou\r\nVocal Mixing by Kazu\r\n\r\nVoice Actors:\r\nMaddie Matsumoto as Raiden Ei/Shogun\r\nDarrel J Delphin as Albedo/L-13/L-1\r\nKevin D Thelwell as Net Nomad\r\nAika Intong as Kokomi\r\nAngel Haven Rey as Mona -\r\nchiisa as Yae Miko\r\nEddy Yeung as Kaveh\r\n\r\nCasting Assistance:\r\nDiana Garnet", "airdate": "", "disc": 0, "duration": "", "subject_id": 729317, "sort": 3, "type": 0}
